# Messages
message.rftools.shiftmessage=<Press Shift>
message.rftools.coalgenerator=\
    @fThis machine produces RF (%s RF/t)\n\
    @ffrom coal or charcoal\n\
    @eInfusing bonus: more power generation\n\
    @eand lasts longer on a single fuel
message.rftools.booster=\
    @fThis blocks gives entities directly on top of this\n\
    @fblock a temporary effect\n\
    @eInfusing bonus: reduced power consumption
message.rftools.infuser=\
    @fWith this machine you can improve most other machines\n\
    @fin RFTools in various ways. This needs dimensional\n\
    @fshards.\n\
    @eInfusing bonus: reduced power consumption.
message.rftools.itemfilter=\
    @aContents: %s stacks\n\
    @fWith this block you can direct items from any side\n\
    @fto any other side. This allows you to make item\n\
    @ffilters for quarries, tree farms, mob farms, ...
message.rftools.security_manager=\
    @aContents: %s stacks\n\
    @fThis block manages your security cards
message.rftools.builder=\
    @fThis block can quarry areas, pump liquids,\n\
    @fmove/copy/swap structures, collect items\n\
    @fand XP, move entities, build structures, ...\n\
    @eInfusing bonus: reduced power consumption\n\
    @eand increased speed.
message.rftools.elevator=\
    @fThis machine needs to be placed at a certain\n\
    @flevel pointing towards where a moving platform\n\
    @fwill be. Only the lowest elevator needs power\n\
    @eInfusing bonus: reduced power consumption
message.rftools.rf_monitor=\
    @fThis device monitors the amount of RF in an adjacent\n\
    @fmachine (select it with the GUI). It can also send\n\
    @fout a redstone signal if the power goes above or below\n\
    @fsome value.
message.rftools.liquid_monitor=\
    @fThis device monitors the amount of liquid in an adjacent\n\
    @fmachine (select it with the GUI). It can also send\n\
    @fout a redstone signal if the liquid goes above or below\n\
    @fsome value.
message.rftools.relay=\
    @fThis device can (based on a redstone signal) limit\n\
    @fthe amount of RF that can go through this. Using this\n\
    @fyou can throttle down (or even disable) a number of\n\
    @fmachines in case power is low.
message.rftools.composer=\
    @fThis block can construct more complex\n\
    @fshape cards for the Builder or Shield\n\
    @fby creating combinations of other shape\n\
    @fcards
message.rftools.locator=\
    @fPlace this block on top of a Scanner\n\
    @fto extend its functionality with the ability\n\
    @fto locate entities and machines using power
message.rftools.projector=\
    @fThis block can project the contents\n\
    @fof a shape card like a hologram
message.rftools.scanner=\
    @2Scan id: %s\n\
    @fThis block can scan an area and link\n\
    @fto shape cards for the Builder or Shield.\n\
    @fThe resulting shape card can also be used\n\
    @fin the Composer
message.rftools.remote_scanner=\
    @2Scan id: %s\n\
    @fThis block can scan an area and link\n\
    @fto shape cards for the Builder or Shield.\n\
    @fThe resulting shape card can also be used\n\
    @fin the Composer\n\
    @6This version can scan scan through a\n\
    @6dialed matter transmitter which should be\n\
    @6located above it
message.rftools.spawner=\
    @fThis block can spawn creatures. It needs a syringe\n\
    @fof the appropriate type, RF power and also it\n\
    @fneeds beams of energized matter.\n\
    @eInfusing bonus: reduced power usage.
message.rftools.environmental_controller=\
    @aArea: radius %s (between %s and %s)\n\
    @fControl the environment around you with various\n\
    @fmodules. There are modules for things like regeneration,\n\
    @fspeed...\n\
    @eInfusing bonus: reduced power consumption.
message.rftools.endergenic=\
    @fGenerate power out of ender pearls. You need at\n\
    @fleast two generators for this to work and the setup\n\
    @fis relatively complicated. Timing is crucial.\n\
    @eInfusing bonus: increased power generation and\n\
    @ereduced powerloss for holding pearls.
message.rftools.pearl_injector=\
    @aContents: %s stacks\n\
    @fThis will inject an ender pearl in an adjacent\n\
    @fendergenic generator when a redstone signal is\n\
    @freceived.
message.rftools.wire=\
    @fThis logic block is just a simple\n\
    @flag free redstone wire
message.rftools.timer=\
    @aDelay: %s\n\
    @fThis logic block emits a redstone pulse\n\
    @fafter a certain amount of time unless it\n\
    @freceives a redstone pulse itself before that.
message.rftools.digit=\
    @fThis logic block is just a simple\n\
    @fdigit that shows the redstone input value
message.rftools.analog=\
    @fThis logic block can do\n\
    @fcalculations on analog redstone
message.rftools.sensor=\
    @fThis logic block gives a redstone signal\n\
    @fdepending on various circumstances in\n\
    @ffront of it. Like block placement, crop\n\
    @fgrowth level, number of entities, ...
message.rftools.invchecker=\
    @fThis logic block gives a redstone signal\n\
    @fif the amount of items in an inventory slot.\n\
    @fexceeds a certain value
message.rftools.threelogic=\
    @fThis logic block can do various logical\n\
    @foperations on three inputs.
message.rftools.counter=\
    @aCounter: %s\n\
    @aCurrent: %s\n\
    @fThis logic block counts redstone pulses and emits\n\
    @fa signal once a certain number has been reached.
message.rftools.sequencer=\
    @aDelay: %s\n\
    @aMode: %s\n\
    @aBits: %s\n\
    @fThis logic block emits a series of redstone\n\
    @fsignals in a pattern that you can set in the GUI.

